WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.833
Step 1: Open Opstack console from the account dropdown and sign in with your Opstack owner or support credentials.

2
00:00:06.833 --> 00:00:15.208
Step 2: An owner can create a network after configuring shared account emails, then enter its code, company, location and first Head Office user.

3
00:00:15.208 --> 00:00:22.667
Step 3: Use Open network to enter with your own support identity. The orange support indicator links back to the console.

4
00:00:22.667 --> 00:00:28.667
Step 4: Owners manage platform accounts and network suspension; review Activity for platform actions.
